OL,3,GNEWSAClosure of 114-year-old tearooms
OL,4,A'unfortunate'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 114-year-old tearoom, visited by the
OL,7,Flikes of Kate Middleton and Cary Grant,
OL,8,Fhas closed.
OL,10,FThe Polly Tearooms in Marlborough,
OL,11,FWiltshire was founded in 1912 and
OL,12,Fbecame a popular spot for both locals
OL,13,Fand tourists in the decades which
OL,14,Ffollowed.
OL,16,FOwner David Clarke MBE, who bought the
OL,17,Fcafe in 2013, said "relentless tax
OL,18,Frises and overhead costs" had forced
OL,19,Fhim to close following an "unfortunate"
OL,20,Fperiod and several challenges since the
OL,21,FCovid pandemic.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
