OL,3,GNEWSAClosure of 114-year-old tearooms
OL,4,A'unfortunate'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe previously came into controversy in
OL,7,F2024 when The Polly Tearooms was named
OL,8,Fby the Government as one of more than
OL,9,F500 firms in the county not paying the
OL,10,Flegal minimum level of pay to its
OL,11,Fworkers.
